[00:13.16]It's a crowded street and there's no one there
[00:18.79]昔日的街头如今空荡
[00:18.79]Everyone is living in fear
[00:25.02]每个人都在恐惧中仿徨
[00:25.02]With all the playgrounds I hear no laughters
